SUMMARY:Arbor Evenings at the Arboretum
DESCRIPTION:Not Dead Yet Asheville's Women in their 50s & 60s\nJoin us on 
 Wednesday July 22... Sip and stroll through the gardens at the Arboretum i
 n the glow of the golden hour\, all while ***listening to live music Celti
 c Road*** (Irish/Scottish instrumentals and songs).\nBring a chair!\nFor A
 rboretum members\, this event is free. Non members can carpool with a memb
 er\, or purchase a parking pass for $25.\nThere is no additional cost to a
 ttend ArborEvenings beyond the standard parking fee. As always\, Arboretum
  Society members and their accompanying guests can enter for FREE (guests 
 must be in member vehicles to receive free entry).\n\nWe will set up a car
 pooling meet spot at a business just outside the Arboretum entrance for an
 y of you that are not members. Please add your interest in carpooling in t
 he discussion space below. If you are a member and want to be a carpool ho
 st\, please also add your interest in the discussion area. Thanks!\n\n***\
 \*\\*Please note: Outside alcohol is prohibited on the campus of The North
  Carolina Arboretum.\\*\\****
